        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-23T15:40:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I agree that he would have his DR. Had the same issue when Internal Dfense Grid tried to shoot my Platform Bot. I always play that passive effects are automatically applied before triggered.</p><p>However, just to play devil's advocate, IDG was in play first so maybe it has precedence. Or, maybe the official ruling that \"When applying damage the players choose the order that effects are applied,\" applies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
